        <mxCell id="p1-title" value="&lt;b&gt;thuum (skymp-parity): what runs where&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=20;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="12" width="1190" height="38" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-sub" value="Baseline: fork mojibake-dev/skymp, branch parity at 45839102 (2026-10-10), wire schema 11. Dashed outlines: M2 work in flight on fork branches m2-effects (9e038edd, wire schema 13) and m2-god (2634d44c, stacked on m2-effects). Hover a shape for its source." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="50" width="1190" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Design law (CLAUDE.md, ADR-002)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The server owns STATE. A host client owns SIMULATION for its cell. The wire carries DELTAS. Everything else is a HOOK. Every piece of state sits on one authority rung, R0 to R3 (legend)." tooltip="Source: CLAUDE.md (The design law); docs/DECISIONS.md ADR-002" id="p1-law">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F2F2;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
            <mxGeometry x="20" y="100" width="1190" height="37" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="p1-status" value="&lt;b&gt;Where the plan stands (docs/PLAN.md)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;M0, lab and baseline: done (smoke-two-players green 2026-10-01). M1, Class A: exit met 2026-10-09 (the Rust wire port, validation, persistence, time, rest, console), then M1.1 (TCL). M2, combat and magic: marksman and spell-cast merged into parity 45839102 on 2026-10-10; magic-effects (m2-effects) and god-mode (m2-god) in flight; headshot, poison and cast-teleport designed, no code yet. M3, hosting: planned; the M0 messages HostGrant and HostRelease are reserved for it." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F2F2F2;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
