        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Records: the host computes, the server records&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Client to server, kept within bounds: animation events and graph variables, the equipment worn, the RaceMenu look, skill progress (ActorValues), learned ingredient effects, favorites, its own health reports (ChangeValues, cropped), the results of delegated Papyrus calls (SpSnippet, FinishSpSnippet)." tooltip="Sources: skymp/skymp-wire/crates/wire-schema/src/skymp.rs (each message's rung); docs/verbs/*.md (Authority); CLAUDE.md (rungs)" id="p1-rb1">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="p1-rung">
