        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Decisions: the server computes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Server to clients: actors (CreateActor, DestroyActor), inventories (SetInventory), health (ChangeValues), deaths, teleports, the game clock (SetGameTime), console replies, relays of accepted moves, casts and shots, changes imposed through a snippet (a fight's StartCombat, AddToMap, Rested). M2: running effects (MagicEffects)." tooltip="Sources: skymp/skymp-wire/crates/wire-schema/src/skymp.rs (each message's rung); docs/verbs/*.md (Authority); CLAUDE.md (rungs)" id="p1-rb2">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="p1-rung">
