        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Animation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• UpdateAnimation (3, 11): both; ch2; 256 B. An animation event, recorded and relayed [R2]&lt;br&gt;• UpdateAnimVariables (24, 32): both; ch0 from the client, ch2 as a relay; 32 KiB. Behavior graph variables [R2]" tooltip="Source: skymp/skymp-wire/crates/wire-schema/src/lib.rs (TABLE), skymp.rs; wire-transport/src/channels.rs; directions and rungs from each message's doc comment; reliability from the senders (skymp/skymp5-client/src/services/services, skymp/skymp5-server/cpp/server_guest_lib/ActionListener.cpp, MpActor.cpp)" id="p3-f1">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="p3-1">
