          <mxGeometry x="276" y="3" width="30" height="14" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Inventory and equipment&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• SetInventory (28, 36): s2c; ch0; 2 MiB. The whole inventory [R0]&lt;br&gt;• UpdateEquipment (5, 13): both; ch0; 256 KiB. What an actor wears, relayed [R2]&lt;br&gt;• OnEquip (11, 19): c2s; ch2 (ch0 on m2-effects); 16 B. Equip, drink, eat, read: the server runs the item [R2]&lt;br&gt;• PutItem (8, 16), TakeItem (9, 17): c2s; ch0; 512 B. Container moves [R1]&lt;br&gt;• DropItem (19, 27): c2s; ch0; 32 B [R1]. CraftItem (13, 21): c2s; ch0; 64 KiB; the recipe is checked [R1]&lt;br&gt;• OpenContainer (21, 29): s2c; ch0; 16 B [R0]" tooltip="Source: skymp/skymp-wire/crates/wire-schema/src/lib.rs (TABLE), skymp.rs; wire-transport/src/channels.rs; directions and rungs from each message's doc comment; reliability from the senders (skymp/skymp5-client/src/services/services, skymp/skymp5-server/cpp/server_guest_lib/ActionListener.cpp, MpActor.cpp)" id="p3-f2">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="p3-1">
