          <mxGeometry x="276" y="3" width="30" height="14" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Combat&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• OnHit (17, 25): c2s; ch0; 64 B. A hit the client saw [R1]: melee reach, cone and flags; an arrow claims a shot, a spell a cast. The damage is the server's [R0] (ADR-028)&lt;br&gt;• PlayerBowShot (22, 30): c2s; ch0; 32 B. The shot, with aim and draw power [R1]&lt;br&gt;• ArrowShot (42, 50): s2c; ch0; 64 B. A neighbour's accepted shot, to launch from its figure&lt;br&gt;• SpellCast (23, 31): both; ch0; 32 KiB. A cast's start or end [R1], relayed reliably&lt;br&gt;• DeathStateContainer (18, 26): s2c; ch0; 66 KiB. Death or resurrection [R0]" tooltip="Source: skymp/skymp-wire/crates/wire-schema/src/lib.rs (TABLE), skymp.rs; wire-transport/src/channels.rs; directions and rungs from each message's doc comment; reliability from the senders (skymp/skymp5-client/src/services/services, skymp/skymp5-server/cpp/server_guest_lib/ActionListener.cpp, MpActor.cpp)" id="p3-f3">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="p3-1">
