        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Attributes and actor values&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• ChangeValues (16, 24): both; ch2 from the client, ch0 from the server; 32 B. Health, magicka and stamina percentages: the client's [R2], cropped by regeneration; the server's [R0]&lt;br&gt;• ActorValues (40, 48): both; ch0; 2 KiB. Bases, skills, level: the client's after an increase [R2]; the server's after a login or a value it set [R0]" tooltip="Source: skymp/skymp-wire/crates/wire-schema/src/lib.rs (TABLE), skymp.rs; wire-transport/src/channels.rs; directions and rungs from each message's doc comment; reliability from the senders (skymp/skymp5-client/src/services/services, skymp/skymp5-server/cpp/server_guest_lib/ActionListener.cpp, MpActor.cpp)" id="p3-f4">
