        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;M2, in flight: magic effects&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• MagicEffects (43, 51): s2c; ch0; 1 KiB. An actor's running effects with the seconds left, and its buff sums [R0]; sent before the ChangeValues of the same change. Wire schema 13 on m2-effects" tooltip="M2, in flight: fork branch m2-effects (9e038edd). Source: skymp/skymp-wire/crates/wire-schema/src/lib.rs (TABLE), skymp.rs; wire-transport/src/channels.rs; directions and rungs from each message's doc comment; reliability from the senders (skymp/skymp5-client/src/services/services, skymp/skymp5-server/cpp/server_guest_lib/ActionListener.cpp, MpActor.cpp)" id="p3-f5">
