        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;World and actors&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• CreateActor (33, 41): s2c; ch0; 2 MiB. Introduces a form with everything needed to show it [R0]&lt;br&gt;• DestroyActor (25, 33): s2c; ch0; 16 B [R0]&lt;br&gt;• UpdateProperty (7, 15): s2c; ch0; 65 KiB. One property of a form [R0]&lt;br&gt;• Activate (6, 14): c2s; ch0; 64 B. Within the game's reach [R1]&lt;br&gt;• Host (14, 22): c2s; ch2; 16 B. Asks to host an actor [R0 decides]. HostStart (26, 34), HostStop (27, 35): s2c; ch0; 16 B. SkyMP's hosting per actor; per cell is M3" tooltip="Source: skymp/skymp-wire/crates/wire-schema/src/lib.rs (TABLE), skymp.rs; wire-transport/src/channels.rs; directions and rungs from each message's doc comment; reliability from the senders (skymp/skymp5-client/src/services/services, skymp/skymp5-server/cpp/server_guest_lib/ActionListener.cpp, MpActor.cpp)" id="p3-f6">
