        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Time and rest&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• SetGameTime (34, 42): s2c; ch0; 32 B. The server's clock, at login ahead of the player's CreateActor, then every 60 s [R0]&lt;br&gt;• RestIntent (35, 43): c2s; ch0; 16 B. Hours waited or slept, 1 to 24 [R1]; the server computes the recovery [R0]" tooltip="Source: skymp/skymp-wire/crates/wire-schema/src/lib.rs (TABLE), skymp.rs; wire-transport/src/channels.rs; directions and rungs from each message's doc comment; reliability from the senders (skymp/skymp5-client/src/services/services, skymp/skymp5-server/cpp/server_guest_lib/ActionListener.cpp, MpActor.cpp)" id="p3-f7">
