        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Console&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• ConsoleCommand (12, 20): c2s; ch0; 16 KiB. The server checks the caller's rank (wire-rules console) [R0]&lt;br&gt;• ConsoleOutput (41, 49): s2c; ch0; 2 KiB. The reply line" tooltip="Source: skymp/skymp-wire/crates/wire-schema/src/lib.rs (TABLE), skymp.rs; wire-transport/src/channels.rs; directions and rungs from each message's doc comment; reliability from the senders (skymp/skymp5-client/src/services/services, skymp/skymp5-server/cpp/server_guest_lib/ActionListener.cpp, MpActor.cpp)" id="p3-f8">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="p3-1">
            <mxGeometry x="1486" y="873" width="314" height="168" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="p3-f8-b0" value="&lt;b&gt;R0&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1A1A1A;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=50;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="p3-f8">
          <mxGeometry x="276" y="3" width="30" height="14" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Appearance and RaceMenu&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• UpdateAppearance (4, 12): both; ch0; 64 KiB. The race menu's result, its race checked [R1], relayed&lt;br&gt;• SetRaceMenuOpen (29, 37): s2c; ch0; 8 B [R0]&lt;br&gt;• RaceMenuPreset (39, 47): both; ch0; 200 KiB. RaceMenu's preset JSON [R2, bounded]; the appearance is derived from it [R0] (ADR-026)" tooltip="Source: skymp/skymp-wire/crates/wire-schema/src/lib.rs (TABLE), skymp.rs; wire-transport/src/channels.rs; directions and rungs from each message's doc comment; reliability from the senders (skymp/skymp5-client/src/services/services, skymp/skymp5-server/cpp/server_guest_lib/ActionListener.cpp, MpActor.cpp)" id="p3-f9">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="p3-1">
            <mxGeometry x="830" y="1055" width="314" height="142" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="p3-f9-b0" value="&lt;b&gt;R1&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#595959;strokeColor=#595959;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=50;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="p3-f9">
          <mxGeometry x="240" y="3" width="30" height="14" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3-f9-b1" value="&lt;b&gt;R2&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#A6A6A6;strokeColor=#808080;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=50;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="p3-f9">
          <mxGeometry x="276" y="3" width="30" height="14" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Player records&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• MapMarkerDiscovered (36, 44): c2s; ch0; 16 B. The marker type only [R1]; the server finds the marker and records it [R0]&lt;br&gt;• IngredientEffectsKnown (37, 45): c2s; ch0; 16 B. Kept only after the server saw the eating, and only grows [R2]&lt;br&gt;• Favorites (38, 46): both; ch0; 1 KiB. Held items kept, magic recorded [R2]; the record goes back at login" tooltip="Source: skymp/skymp-wire/crates/wire-schema/src/lib.rs (TABLE), skymp.rs; wire-transport/src/channels.rs; directions and rungs from each message's doc comment; reliability from the senders (skymp/skymp5-client/src/services/services, skymp/skymp5-server/cpp/server_guest_lib/ActionListener.cpp, MpActor.cpp)" id="p3-f10">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="p3-1">
