        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Snippets&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• SpSnippet (30, 38): s2c; ch0; 1 MiB. Run a Papyrus call in that game, ledgered in docs/NATIVES.md [R2]&lt;br&gt;• FinishSpSnippet (10, 18): c2s; ch0; 17 KiB. Its result [R2]" tooltip="Source: skymp/skymp-wire/crates/wire-schema/src/lib.rs (TABLE), skymp.rs; wire-transport/src/channels.rs; directions and rungs from each message's doc comment; reliability from the senders (skymp/skymp5-client/src/services/services, skymp/skymp5-server/cpp/server_guest_lib/ActionListener.cpp, MpActor.cpp)" id="p3-f11">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="p3-1">
            <mxGeometry x="1486" y="1055" width="314" height="142" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="p3-f11-b0" value="&lt;b&gt;R2&lt;/b&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#A6A6A6;strokeColor=#808080;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=9;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;arcSize=50;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="p3-f11">
          <mxGeometry x="276" y="3" width="30" height="14" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;Session and gamemode&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• CustomPacket (1, 9): both; ch0; 1 MiB + 16 B. The login (loginWithSkympIo) and gamemode JSON&lt;br&gt;• CustomEvent (15, 23): c2s; ch0; 256 KiB. A gamemode event&lt;br&gt;• UpdateGamemodeData (32, 40): s2c; ch0; 4 MiB. The gamemode's client-side code&lt;br&gt;• Rung: the gamemode's" tooltip="Source: skymp/skymp-wire/crates/wire-schema/src/lib.rs (TABLE), skymp.rs; wire-transport/src/channels.rs; directions and rungs from each message's doc comment; reliability from the senders (skymp/skymp5-client/src/services/services, skymp/skymp5-server/cpp/server_guest_lib/ActionListener.cpp, MpActor.cpp)" id="p3-f12">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="p3-1">
            <mxGeometry x="830" y="1211" width="314" height="116" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;M0 family, reserved (ids 0 to 8)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Hello, Welcome, Refuse, Movement, Hit, HostedActor, InventoryApply, HostGrant, HostRelease: the authority model's messages. They have no JSON form, so neither end sends them yet; HostGrant and HostRelease wait for M3's cell hosting." tooltip="Source: skymp/skymp-wire/crates/wire-schema/src/lib.rs (TABLE), skymp.rs; wire-transport/src/channels.rs; directions and rungs from each message's doc comment; reliability from the senders (skymp/skymp5-client/src/services/services, skymp/skymp5-server/cpp/server_guest_lib/ActionListener.cpp, MpActor.cpp)" id="p3-f13">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFE6CC;strokeColor=#D79B00;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="p3-1">
            <mxGeometry x="1158" y="1211" width="314" height="116" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
      </root>
