        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;One T3 run&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. just lab-run &amp;lt;scenario&amp;gt; posts the YAML to POST /lab/run; the game version is the request's, else the scenario's, else 1.6.1170.&lt;br&gt;2. lab-api rolls the clones back through the Proxmox API and starts the server on that version's masters and settings.&lt;br&gt;3. Each clone's logon launcher asks GET /lab/game for its folder; skymp5-client connects over UDP 7777.&lt;br&gt;4. lab-driver polls GET /lab/step, runs each step in the game (move, cast, console, tap-key...) and posts its result.&lt;br&gt;5. lab-api judges server-side steps through labState (POST :3000/rpc/labState to gamemode.js) and checks the assertions.&lt;br&gt;6. result.json, logs, screenshots, the pcap, the world diff and Frida traces land in rpool/sky/results." tooltip="Source: docs/LAB.md (Scenario runner); lab/labapi/CONTRACT.md" id="p5-steps">
          <mxCell style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;spacingBottom=3;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="p5-1">
